WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
- You're a fan favorite
on Real Housewives,

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.450
but your first season is almost done.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.050
So would you come back?
Would you do it again?

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:09.606
- Well, we first have to
see if I'm invited back.

00:00:09.606 --> 00:00:10.439
(audience laughs)

00:00:10.439 --> 00:00:12.272
- Oh. I'm inviting you back to the show.

00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:13.760
(both laugh)

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.970
I have no say, but I think you
should go back to the show.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.270
- Well, this Friday we do the reunion,

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:23.260
so between that, and then meeting you,

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:25.300
I did not sleep last night.
- Oh!

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.850
- By the way, I love you so much.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:29.630
I have Vaseline in my
mouth and on my teeth,

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.870
and my hands are freezing-
- I love you!

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.730
- And it's because of you and the reunion.

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:36.840
- Oh my gosh, that's so
awesome. That's so nice to know.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.980
Wait, but the reunion
should be fun, right?

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.640
- Well, the reunion will be fun,

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.680
but what I'm trying to say is,

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.120
about two weeks after the reunion,

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.020
we find out if we're invited back.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.640
- Man, they keep you going. Yeah, okay.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.240
- I mean, I would love to.
- Yeah.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.650
That's cool though, you loved it.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.453
- I had really, a lot of fun.
- Yeah.

